(Bug #4 regression: top-level globals of non-number scalar types also retain mutations made inside functions.)

a float called f is 1.5.
a boolean called flag_value is false.
a text called s is "hi".
a buffer called b is "x".

To 'incf'.
  Set f to {f add 2.5}.

To 'toggle'.
  Set flag_value to not flag_value.

To 'extend'.
  Set s to "{s}!".

To 'grow'.
  Append "y" to b.


'incf'.
'toggle'.
'extend'.
'grow'.
Print f.
Print flag_value.
Print s.
Print b.
